Error [E0157]: `state Door { … }` is not a type declaration
  --> tests/ui/typestate/retired_top_level_state_companion_teaches_nested_owner.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | state Door { Ready }
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate facts belong to the struct that owns them; a sibling declaration repeats the type name and creates a false namespace boundary
 Fix: Move the states into the owner: write `struct Door` with `state { Ready }` inside its body
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0157
